# netlist of sch_divider.sch, from schnet
part C201 capacitor value 1uF swap 1,2 name divider.c
part D201 diode name divider.clamp
part R201 resistor value 10k swap 1,2 name divider.top
part R202 resistor value 4.7k swap 1,2 name divider.bottom
net +5V global R201.1
net 3V3 global D201.2
net GND global C201.2 R202.2
net divider.top.2 C201.1 D201.1 R201.2 R202.1
